WEBVTT

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:31.505
as a politician.

00:19:31.529 --> 00:19:33.626
JL: I've been so impressed

00:19:35.033 --> 00:19:38.851
with this new breed
of young men and young women

00:19:38.875 --> 00:19:41.029
that are coming into elected positions.

00:19:41.053 --> 00:19:44.638
It's not just at the national level
but also at the local level.

00:19:44.662 --> 00:19:48.130
And I think we, now more than ever before,

00:19:48.154 --> 00:19:52.442
need men and women of conscience

00:19:52.466 --> 00:19:54.571
as judges,

00:19:54.595 --> 00:19:57.109
especially on the federal level,

00:19:57.133 --> 00:19:59.249
but also at the state and local level,

00:19:59.273 --> 00:20:01.422
to say, "We've got to mend.